{sov: Notes}
Dorian Groove: The main body of the song is anchored by a smooth two-chord
vamp (Am7 to D7) establishing an A Dorian modal feel.

Hook Breakdown: The "Time keeps on slippin'" line shifts out of the vamp to a
maj7 color with Fmaj7 resolving to C before cycling right back to Am7.

Space and Texture: The guitar part relies on clean, spacey strumming with heavy
delay or phaser effects to complement the organ synth sweeps.
{eov}